// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P256287544" "You can still save the child, Jimmy Preston. Shortly after Cyrus was taken from the train station, Jimmy was abducted from his tenement in Kings Row. I've found a report from that time filed by operatives from MAGI saying they "sensed" a child being held in a nearby warehouse. I believe this is Jimmy Preston. <color orange>It's imperative that we rescue young Jimmy</color>, as he is even more important than the matter at hand, but...I cannot tell you any more about the 'coming storm' without putting it all at risk. Just know that with the advent of their master's arrival, the Circle of Thorns grows ever stronger. <br><br>Are you up to this task?"
// AcceptString :
"P209375859" "Rescue Jimmy Preston from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P821248986" "Go back and find Jimmy, you must bring him forward so that he can be removed from the events of his time."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3700779161" "Save Jimmy Preston"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2386968000" "Why have you returned without Jimmy Preston?  Go... save him in time... for the sake of the world!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

