"P3137025096" "Rubish"
// InteractBeginString :
"P4019070619" "Something compels you search through this trash can."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3711897092" "You've found something buried at the bottom of the trash."
// InteractActionString :
"P2910514872" "Rummaging..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3587457186" "You've found a hand written letter addressed to {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P419862608" "You have defeated the Sitrix and saved all of the hostages, but Candy was not among them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2610793579" "No! They've managed to capture all three of them! We have little to no idea where they will perform their arcane ritual. <br><br>But...there might be a chance. Given the clues we've accumulated, I might been able to divine an area where the ceremony may take place. It's a slim chance, and even if you can find it, the odds of you going back to exactly the right time and of you defeating their assembled forces are practically nil. Still, I have faith in you, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4075269978" "With all three keys, <color red>Baron Zoria</color> can start the ritual that brings his nearly-omnipotent master to earth. There is a very small window of time in which he can do so, however. If you can find that exact moment in time to interrupt the ceremony, even for a few seconds, he will lose that opportunity. <br><br>Can I count on you to stop this evil?"
// AcceptString :
"P270493926" "Find the Circle of Thorns and stop their heinous ceremony"
// SendOffString :
"P3235211995" "The world of today and tomorrow needs you! Go and stop this ceremony before it's too late."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3768494372" "Stop the Circle of Thorns"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1711229911" "There are mere moments left to save the earth, and time itself! Go now!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3701972778" "<color deepskyblue>Part Finale</color>"

