// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P358006790" "You have saved Jimmy Preston and Candy Lebeaux, thus, thwarting Baron Zoria's attempts to summon his demon. Regretfully, Cyrus died before you could arrive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P975338565" "Rarely have I seen such acts of heroism, in this time or any other. You have honored all those who came before you, and you have set a standard for all those that will follow. I salute you, {HeroName}. And grieve not for the noble Breakneck. As a man of the future, I can assure you that his legacy will never die."

